  "description": "The rear left hand corner will be infilled up to a height of 3 storeys following demolition of the portakabin classroom and toilets. The main rear single storey building will be retained and a new structure will be built upon it to the rear right hand side. The main right hand three- storey wing will be extended to match the length of the left hand wing after the demolition of the outbuilding. The left hand side single storey wing will be extended by two further storeys. Galleries at first and second levels will link the classrooms and form a porch at ground floor level to provide a sheltered amenity and school bus waiting area. Various internal refurbishment and improvements. Reconfiguration of existing car parking."
